<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
    <%- include('section/head') %>
    <title>對話中 - Wu Jo</title>
    <style>
        /* ==========================================
           全純 CSS 控制，完全不依賴任何 Tailwind
           ========================================== */
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: #FAFAFA !important; /* Wu Jo 清爽白底 */
            color: #333333 !important;
            padding-bottom: 100px; /* 留空間給底部的輸入欄 */
        }

        /* 頂部聊天對象導覽列 */
        .chat-header-bar {
            position: fixed;
            top: 70px; /* 避開頂部主導覽列 */
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 60px;
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #EFEFEF;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 0 20px;
            z-index: 99;
        }

        .back-btn {
            text-decoration: none;
            color: #823A00;
            font-weight: bold;
            margin-right: 16px;
            font-size: 14px;
        }

        /* ❌ 就是這裡！嚴格限制頭貼大小，絕對不會再塞滿螢幕 */
        .chat-target-avatar {
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background-color: #FAFAFA;
            border: 2px solid #F5EFEA;
            margin-right: 12px;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .chat-target-name {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #222222;
        }

        /* 聊天泡泡主容器 */
        .chat-main-container {
            max-width: 480px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 150px 20px 100px 20px; /* 上方留空給兩個 header */
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 16px;
        }

        /* 訊息泡泡共用樣式 */
        .message-row {
            display: flex;
            width: 100%;
        }

        /* 他人傳送的訊息（靠左） */
        .message-row.received {
            justify-content: flex-start;
        }

        /* 自己傳送的訊息（靠右） */
        .message-row.sent {
            justify-content: flex-end;
        }

        .bubble {
            max-width: 70%;
            padding: 12px 16px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.5;
            word-break: break-all;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);
        }

        /* 他人泡泡：灰色底 */
        .received .bubble {
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            color: #333333;
            border: 1px solid #EFEFEF;
            border-top-left-radius: 4px;
        }

        /* 自己泡泡：Wu Jo 焦糖金棕底 */
        .sent .bubble {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #B37A48 0%, #823A00 100%);
            color: #FFFFFF;
            border-top-right-radius: 4px;
        }

        /* 底部對話輸入欄 */
        .chat-input-wrapper {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: 70px; /* 避開最底下的分頁選單 */
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            background-color: #FFFFFF;
            border-top: 1px solid #EFEFEF;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            z-index: 99;
        }

        .chat-input-container {
            max-width: 440px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .message-input {
            flex: 1;
            height: 40px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 1px solid #EFEFEF;
            background-color: #FAFAFA;
            padding: 0 16px;
            font-size: 14px;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.2s;
        }

        .message-input:focus {
            border-color: #B37A48;
        }

        .send-btn {
            height: 40px;
            padding: 0 20px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: none;
            background-color: #823A00;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 14px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: background-color 0.2s;
        }

        .send-btn:hover {
            background-color: #632C00;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <%- include('section/nav') %>

    <div class="chat-header-bar">
        <a href="/messages" class="back-btn">← 返回</a>
        <img src="https://api.dicebear.com/7.x/avataaars/svg?seed=<%= chatTarget.avatar %>" class="chat-target-avatar" alt="avatar">
        <span class="chat-target-name"><%= chatTarget.name %></span>
    </div>

    <main class="chat-main-container">
        
        <div class="message-row received">
            <div class="bubble">
                嗨！請問這週二晚上你有空一起在 Kinetics Studio 練舞嗎？
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="message-row sent">
            <div class="bubble">
                有空啊！我要練 Popping，你那天打算練什麼舞風？
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="message-row received">
            <div class="bubble">
                太好了，我想抓一下 House 的基礎律動，到時候教室見！
            </div>
        </div>

    </main>

    <div class="chat-input-wrapper">
        <div class="chat-input-container">
            <input type="text" class="message-input" placeholder="輸入訊息...">
            <button class="send-btn">傳送</button>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>